HISTORY

@VERSION@ (@DATE@)
* first AROS build, from bebboget 1.11 with the fixes I sent upstream:
  certificate dates, RSA work buffers, P-384 reduction, ECDSA curve choice,
  SHA-384/SHA-512 RSA signatures, long ASN.1 lengths, variadic lists on
  64 bit, http:// port, quoted file names, truncated downloads, the lock of a
  new certificate directory, Content-Length split across reads
